      "properties": {"text": "LAURA IMAGE STUDIO - Virtual Dressing Room\n\nHow to use:\n1. Load your SDXL checkpoint model (Juggernaut, RealVisXL, etc.)\n2. Upload a FACE image (your reference face)\n3. Upload a MODEL IMAGE (the body/person to dress)\n4. Upload clothing items: TOP, BOTTOM, SHOES\n5. Edit the Person Prompt to describe the pose/scene\n6. Edit the Background Prompt for your background\n7. Hit Queue Prompt!\n\nThe clothing segmentation automatically detects where to apply each clothing item.\nIPAdapter transfers the appearance from your reference images.\nReActor swaps the face. RMBG removes the background.\n\nRequired packages: ComfyUI-RMBG, ComfyUI-ReActor, ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus,\nComfyUI-ConstrainResolution, ComfyUI-AutoCropFaces"},
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "title": "Instructions"
    }
  ],
